  {
   "id": 524222,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Transmission of signals between two neurons requires proper communication between neurons. Dendrites are a component of many neurons that facilitate signal reception. Which of the following is true of dendrites?",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1029216,
     "content_html": "All neurons have several dendrites for signal reception."
    },
    {
     "id": 1029217,
     "content_html": "Dendritic spines decrease possible synaptic connections."
    },
    {
     "id": 1029218,
     "content_html": "Dendrites carry the signal to the soma."
    },
    {
     "id": 1029219,
     "content_html": "Chemical release at dendrites allows signal communication to other cells."
    }
   ],
